# CLAUDE.local.md — private overlay

**Gitignored.** Project-private supplement to `CLAUDE.md`. Claude
Code auto-loads this; the public repo never sees it. Workspace backup:
`tick-trader-percore-workspace/CLAUDE.local.md.backup` via
`/sync-workspace`.

**This file is an INDEX.** Each rule = one-line statement + one-line
trigger + canonical-doc pointer. Deep-dive bodies (Why + How to
apply + worked examples + anti-patterns) live in:

- `tick-trader-percore-workspace/DESIGN_SPECS/<pattern>.md` — pattern bodies
- `DOCS/RECURRING_BUG_PATTERNS.md` — bug class registry
- `DOCS/TECH_DEBT.md`, `DOCS/PARITY_ISSUES.md`, `FEATURE_LOOKUP.md` — auto-write ledgers
- `~/.claude/projects/-home-caramel-code-FoxML-Trader-v2/memory/` — feedback / user / project memories
- `tick-trader-percore-workspace/claude-skills/<skill>/SKILL.md` — operational contracts
- `tick-trader-percore-workspace/DOCS/LANDMINES.md` — operational pitfalls
- `tick-trader-percore-workspace/DOCS/DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY.md` — thematic narrative + 4-tier discipline classification (HARD / STRONG / SOFT / PROCESS) + cross-reference index; the WHY companion to `CLAUDE.md`'s operational orientation (consolidated CLAUDE.md items 1-30 + adjacent principles)
- `CLAUDE.md` — slimmed to operational orientation + 13 hard invariants + reference table (~205 lines; always loaded)

Skills that fire on relevant work load matching DESIGN_SPECS bodies
dynamically — see "Skill load contracts" below.

