## Skill load contracts

Skills that fire on relevant work pre-load matching deep-dive bodies
so cold sessions / fresh contexts have full pattern access. Updated
contracts in each skill spec:

| Skill | Loads dynamically |
|---|---|
| `/handoff` | CLAUDE.local.md + CLAUDE.md (slim; always-loaded) + DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY.md narrative sections matching plan surface + DESIGN_SPECS/README.md catalog + MEMORY.md + TECH_DEBT.md + PARITY_ISSUES.md + plan file + sprint MASTER. Scans plan for pattern symptoms → cites matched DESIGN_SPECS docs in generated prompt Step 3 + DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY family sections in Step 4. |
| `/readiness` Check 27 | Composes `/dod-audit` inline; reads DESIGN_SPECS/*.md catalog dynamically. |
| `/dod-audit` | Reads DESIGN_SPECS/*.md catalog dynamically; registry-driven, future patterns auto-included. |
| `/parity-check` | Loads `wire-format-byte-preservation-discipline.md` + `autopopulate-pattern-for-production-caller-class.md` + `x-macro-registry-with-presence-dispatch.md` per its scan. |
| `/trace-deps` | Loads `structural-fix-preferred-decision-framework.md` for Step 6 call-sequence enumeration. |
| `/bug-check` | Reads `DOCS/RECURRING_BUG_PATTERNS.md` registry dynamically. |
| `/merge-scan` | Compose-by-reference reads relevant DESIGN_SPECS when surfacing candidates. |

